+ 'Hive 地址须为完整的 HTTPS 网址。':'Enter a complete HTTPS URL for Hive.',
+ 'Hive 地址不能包含用户名或密码。':'The Hive address cannot contain a username or password.',
+ 'Hive 地址不能包含路径、查询参数或片段。':'The Hive address cannot contain a path, query, or fragment.',
+ '远程 Hive 必须使用 HTTPS；HTTP 仅限本机回环地址。':'Remote Hive requires HTTPS; HTTP is allowed only for loopback addresses.',
+ '请填写设备名称。':'Enter a device name.',
+ '设备名称不能包含控制字符。':'The device name cannot contain control characters.',
+ '设备名称最多为 80 个字符。':'The device name can contain at most 80 characters.',
+ '查看错误详情':'View error details','关闭错误详情':'Close error details','错误详情':'Error details','关闭':'Close',
+ '正在检查设备…':'Checking device…','无法确认设备状态':'Device status could not be confirmed','设备已绑定':'Device bound','设置这台设备':'Set up this device',
+ '设置步骤':'Setup steps','连接 Hive':'Connect to Hive','绑定设备':'Bind device',
+ '正在读取本机配置与设备状态…':'Reading local configuration and device status…',
+ '重新检查设备':'Check device again','修复当前问题':'Fix current issue',
+ '设备':'Device','归属账号':'Owner account','下一步：接入 AI 账号':'Next: connect an AI account',
+ '接入后才能使用该账号参与贡献。':'Connect an account before using it to contribute.',
+ '前往接入 AI 账号':'Connect an AI account','进入概览':'Go to overview',
+ 'Hive 地址':'Hive address','设备名称':'Device name',
+ '填写你要连接的 Hive 服务地址。':'Enter the address of the Hive service you want to connect to.',
+ '用于在 Hive 中识别这台设备。':'Used to identify this device in Hive.',
